=3 Notes
* Wamouracampa blaze spikes do a huge amount of damage and will often require 2 dispels to remove.

=2 Walkthrough
Destroy all the Wamouras.
* After a certain amount of time, some of the Wamouracampa will evolve into Wamouras.
* The {p:Rune of Release} will spawn in the southwest of (H-8) when all Ranch Wamourcampas and Ranch Wamouras have been defeated.

